sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as vey CLI
    participant Hub as Hub command broker
    participant Authority as External receipt authority
    participant Archive as Encrypted archive
    participant Exporter as Redactor exporter
    participant Agent as Enrolled agent
    participant ELK as Optional ELK
    CLI->>Hub: Submit one opaque command; no PTY
    Hub->>Agent: Live authorization and prepare identity
    Agent-->>Hub: Prepared OS identity and limits
    alt Standard profile
        Hub->>Agent: Dispatch without external audit dependency
    else Enhanced profile
        Hub->>Authority: Preserve exact intent and attachment
        Authority->>Archive: Store exact encrypted immutable version
        Archive-->>Authority: Durability and version confirmed
        Authority-->>Hub: Signed receipt
        Hub->>Agent: Dispatch only after receipt verification
    end
    Agent-->>Hub: Separate ordered stdout and stderr streams
    Hub-->>CLI: Relay stdout and stderr unchanged
    Agent-->>Hub: Exit result or explicit uncertain outcome
    Hub-->>CLI: Relay final process result
    opt Enhanced asynchronous projection
        Exporter->>Archive: Read exact immutable archived versions
        Exporter->>ELK: Index redacted searchable projection only
    end
    Note over CLI,Agent: No automatic retry; remote output is not archived
